                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8537f092-15c4-3efa-819d-53abc403628c",
                        "entry_id": "0397f167-6c27-3ba1-a871-bbdd0a8d4978",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ein herausragender Spieler; Elitespieler"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Computerspieler-Jargon"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3da8fb9f-7d73-4ccb-a3d2-dcbc5c533ee6",
                                "sense_id": "8537f092-15c4-3efa-819d-53abc403628c",
                                "text": "Es kommt nur selten vor, dass ein Noob einen Gosu killt."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0ffcd88f-10d6-4a43-a634-a8efc78682b5",
                        "source_entry_id": "0397f167-6c27-3ba1-a871-bbdd0a8d4978",
                        "source_sense_id": "8537f092-15c4-3efa-819d-53abc403628c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Computerspieler-Jargon: ein herausragender Spieler; Elitespieler",
                        "target_lang_word": "gosu",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gosu",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6c79b8b-c36b-37c0-804b-37c90de85979",
                                        "entry_id": "1f5e0efb-daa1-366d-a7ce-c4b37806d633",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person of great skill; master; expert."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6522b0f9-d19e-4993-98ca-503820ab5590",
                                                "sense_id": "b6c79b8b-c36b-37c0-804b-37c90de85979",
                                                "text": "of course it is possible to become that good, but have u ever played a gosu? thats really krass. i would not say he is the best. there r many as good as him and it will become more n more difficult to become a good starcraft player."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49591f06-d014-474e-955a-32ce80d355e8",
                                                "sense_id": "b6c79b8b-c36b-37c0-804b-37c90de85979",
                                                "text": "it's not too late to start playing it and become a gosu before your friends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76eec9e0-cdba-4bbf-a2a5-a85b0c7399f0",
                                                "sense_id": "b6c79b8b-c36b-37c0-804b-37c90de85979",
                                                "text": "I need 50 000 Euros for that project, if one of the gosus here made enough bucks with bw to gimme some, reply to sender :o)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a17c26c-95fd-48e7-acc1-8c74c2fed01f",
                                                "sense_id": "b6c79b8b-c36b-37c0-804b-37c90de85979",
                                                "text": "the guy you play is a gosu and like you so he let you play and have fuin^([sic]) before killing you, but you're damn too slow"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5017553-6359-4130-be08-40ebbc2b71a5",
                                                "sense_id": "b6c79b8b-c36b-37c0-804b-37c90de85979",
                                                "text": "But I've never considered myself as a gosu out of my LAN, where I r0x each and every n00b friends I have."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad894d5d-f49f-4cf7-bcf2-8abf4ef4f652",
                                                "sense_id": "b6c79b8b-c36b-37c0-804b-37c90de85979",
                                                "text": "I am not trying to make a fanclub or fame for myself. Some gosus seem to play solely for these purposes, I, you see, get kicks from pissing them off."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a8621b2-ce80-4e8f-ac55-9df7deb81afc",
                                                "sense_id": "b6c79b8b-c36b-37c0-804b-37c90de85979",
                                                "text": "But that bliss came to an end, I really enjoyed playing that way mostly because it did piss so many \"wanna-be-gosus\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66784dde-b1ed-4d7a-b4a4-16a103b1c8e1",
                                                "sense_id": "b6c79b8b-c36b-37c0-804b-37c90de85979",
                                                "text": "I was playing alongside gosu‘s like KaJ, Zeus, Kiko and the successful FuRy/LaWn 2v2 team."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "gosu",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40f8a2af-ef33-3fd9-afa0-8cb3bf3939c6",
                                        "entry_id": "794d9296-4463-33e5-9d13-cbcdcdba8e17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exceptional in skill; elite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00dde14b-aab4-4029-b978-b712a2872ab1",
                                                "sense_id": "40f8a2af-ef33-3fd9-afa0-8cb3bf3939c6",
                                                "text": "Like I said, winning against a newbie doesn't makes^([sic]) you gosu."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46507d55-2f94-444b-83ee-4dae38cc9b1e",
                                                "sense_id": "40f8a2af-ef33-3fd9-afa0-8cb3bf3939c6",
                                                "text": "Yeah, you're too gosu for me, be it WarCraft or StarCraft. Me = Nuubie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52773a52-16a0-4dc7-8de3-9698a3a34970",
                                                "sense_id": "40f8a2af-ef33-3fd9-afa0-8cb3bf3939c6",
                                                "text": "Alternatively you can hold down F4 for the entire game with your vestigial human tailbone and the same thing will occur. This is much harder to do because the vestigial human tailbone isn't very long and humans haven't needed it in, oh, seven million years. The most gosu players can do this while playing a 1v7c game, having cybersex with six girls on AIM, *and* getting it on with their two girlfriends in realtime while playing pingpong against the entire Chinese pingpong team."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e2b03b3-97f5-4322-b937-2766fde8864e",
                                                "sense_id": "40f8a2af-ef33-3fd9-afa0-8cb3bf3939c6",
                                                "text": "It's comparable to a bunch of gosu Korean players beating you into the ground in two minutes with an SCV rush."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "275538b1-81a9-4baa-85de-8965640e5cfa",
                                                "sense_id": "40f8a2af-ef33-3fd9-afa0-8cb3bf3939c6",
                                                "text": "Towers were \"too strong\" at first, gosu players whined about n00bs who built them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2ad6b23a-1bbb-44e7-959a-d95b951ea47b",
                        "source_entry_id": "0397f167-6c27-3ba1-a871-bbdd0a8d4978",
